WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.925
Lab 1 needs only a laptop with
PowerShell 7 and Pester, and no tenant.

2
00:00:04.925 --> 00:00:09.174
First you run Learn's tables exactly
as published, and one test makes

3
00:00:09.174 --> 00:00:13.575
the point plainly: the on-premises
table never rules out a user account.

4
00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:18.300
Then you list what the task needs, two
read permissions and nothing but reads.

5
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.800
Then you run the first two chapters and
the matrix over the fictional estate.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.995
The summary tells you how many
identities are in scope and proposed,

7
00:00:26.995 --> 00:00:30.591
how many owners have decided,
and that the gate isn't met yet,

8
00:00:30.591 --> 00:00:33.190
which is exactly what
we want to read next.
